OL,3,AWhat the Meta settlement means for the
OL,4,AUK, and other questions after the deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta's $18bn (#13.3bn) settlement with
OL,7,Fnearly every US state is about more
OL,8,Fthan money.
OL,10,FAs part of the deal, Facebook and
OL,11,FInstagram have agreed to bring in
OL,12,Fseveral significant measures to protect
OL,13,Fchildren online - though Meta has not
OL,14,Fadmitted to any wrongdoing.
OL,16,FThese include time limits, warnings
OL,17,Fover screen time and more parental
OL,18,Fcontrols over their children's
OL,19,Faccounts.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
